 "intro_zh": "井冈山是集人文景观、自然风光和高山田园为一体的山岳型风景旅游区。在这里创建了以宁冈县为中心的中国第一个农村革命根据地，开辟了“以农村包围城市、武装夺取政权”的具有中国特色的革命道路，从此鲜为人知的井冈山被载入中国革命历史的光荣史册，被誉为“中国革命的摇篮”和“中华人民共和国的奠基石”。",
 "intro_en": "Jinggangshan is a mountainous scenic tourist area integrating cultural landscape, natural scenery and alpine countryside. China's first rural revolutionary base centered on Ninggang County was created here, and a revolutionary path with Chinese characteristics of \"encircling the city with the countryside and seizing power with armed force\" was opened. Since then, the little-known Jinggang Mountain has been recorded in the glorious annals of Chinese revolutionary history, and is known as the \"cradle of the Chinese revolution\" and \"the cornerstone of the People's Republic of China.\"",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
